-inline\">7</code></td>\n<td align=\"center\">○</td>\n<td><code class=\"language-math math-inline\">\\tau^+</code> (antitau); on divisor: <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">\\mathfrak{c}^{\\sigma}</code></td>\n<td>mirror of above</td>\n<td align=\"center\"><code class=\"language-math math-inline\">0</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code class=\"language-math math-inline\">T_{2,9}</code></td>\n<td><code class=\"language-math math-inline\">T_{2,9}</code></td>\n<td><code class=\"language-math math-inline\">9_1</code></td>\n<td align=\"center\"><code class=\"language-math math-inline\">4</code></td>\n<td align=\"center\"><code class=\"language-math math-inline\">9</code></td>\n<td align=\"center\">●</td>\n<td>Strong binding (gluon)</td>\n<td><code class=\"language-math math-inline\">-q^{-28} + \\cdots + q^{-19}</code></td>\n<td align=\"center\"><code class=\"language-math math-inline\">0</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code class=\"language-math math-inline\">T_{3,4}</code></td>\n<td><code class=\"language-math math-inline\">T_{3,4}</code></td>\n<td><code class=\"language-math math-inline\">8_{19}</code></td>\n<td align=\"center\"><code class=\"language-math math-inline\">3</code></td>\n<td align=\"center\"><code class=\"language-math math-inline\">8</code></td>\n<td align=\"center\">●</td>\n<td>Hopf<code class=\"language-math math-inline\">{}^2</code> color binding</td>\n<td><code class=\"language-math math-inline\">q^{-7} - q^{-6} + q^{-5} - 2q^{-4} + q^{-3} + q^{-1}</code></td>\n<td align=\"center\"><code class=\"language-math math-inline\">0</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code class=\"language-math math-inline\">T_{3,5}</code></td>\n<td><code class=\"language-math math-inline\">T_{3,5}</code></td>\n<td><code class=\"language-math math-inline\">10_{124}</code></td>\n<td align=\"center\"><code class=\"language-math math-inline\">4</code></td>\n<td align=\"center\"><code class=\"language-math math-inline\">10</code></td>\n<td align=\"center\">●</td>\n<td>Weak force